{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2019b.q19.material.recovered", "text": "王老师在教学《海底世界》一课时，通过播放海底奇妙风光的视频，让学生在色、光、音的美妙组合下，对海底世界有整体的感知；通过演示课件，展示海面图景，启发学生理解“波涛澎湃”的含义，播放“海底听音器”，模拟海底的声音，帮助学生理解“窃窃私语”的含义；通过鼓励学生在黑板上画出自己心目中的海底世界，深化学生对海洋知识的理解。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b1e339dc718a5e608262780aeb18220f2dde66326e666e39511b32ed6ecdde76", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1887, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2045, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 19, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "b1e339dc718a5e608262780aeb18220f2dde66326e666e39511b32ed6ecdde76"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2019b.q19"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m5.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.design"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.202.r001", "ntce.outline.202.r031", "ntce.outline.202.r046"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2019b.q19"], "word_count": 158, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b1e339dc718a5e608262780aeb18220f2dde66326e666e39511b32ed6ecdde76", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1887, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2045, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 19, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "b